@startuml forms-vol10-flow
title Sample flow - forensic medical examination (volume 10)
autonumber

participant "Law\nenforcement" as LE
participant "Forensic\nbureau (vol 10)" as FB
participant "Forensic\nlabs" as LAB

LE -> FB : case referred (body or living person)
alt deceased
  FB -> FB : 233 thanatology registration\n229 examination report
else living person
  FB -> FB : 234 outpatient registration\n229 examination report
end
FB -> LAB : 231 lab referral, 232 histology referral
LAB -> LAB : 238 histology, 236/237 biology,\n241/242 chemistry, 245 criminalistics
LAB -> FB : results
FB -> LE : 230 expert conclusion

note over FB, LAB
  A distinct legal domain. The lab steps are analysis
  reports like volume 3, but the volume as a whole is
  out of clinical-integration scope.
end note
@enduml
